      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kAQ21BoeWac&t=11s\n@{5a3ad8ac4a8da67427803715|full_name}  We took a small batch of our community and tested out the issue we are having. The world uses a weapon vending machine. Other worlds where the guns are already placed to grab have this issue.\nwrld_d113e803-914c-4233-bb05-b180ff5adda1\nThe world ID here is our test world we have been using. Also our weapons are originally based off learning from the JetDogs prefab.\nIf you need any more information please let us know. We are more than happy to help.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5ea782986fbf9f4ea36b6a44",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5a3ad8ac4a8da67427803715",
        "alias": "Proposed Gibbon",
        "aliasID": "65c27aa0ed6eefce4c6c34a0",
